        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on scope, objectives, and initial roles for the internship programme.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, kicking off the 'Inclusive Hospitality Internship Programme'. The main goal is to design and pilot a programme for students from diverse backgrounds. Let's first align on the objective and how we'll measure success. I've started a doc for our needs assessment (T1).",
            "mentions": [
              52968,
              45096,
              72802,
              19278,
              497314
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 19278,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks for starting. From an operational standpoint, success means minimal disruption for the hotels. We should target hotels that are not luxury-tier, maybe 3-4 star chains. They have more standardized processes and are often more open to community initiatives than boutique places. This will be key for T7.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 45096,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Good point. For the objective, should we specify what 'diverse backgrounds' means? It could be socioeconomic, educational, ethnic, etc. Defining this will be important for the research design in T1 and the resulting A1 report.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1",
