            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 52968,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Yes, we need to be clear on the goals. The objective should probably mention policy alignment. I can look into that for my part of the project.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Excellent point. Let's start with a focus on socioeconomic diversity and students from non-traditional educational pathways. We can refine this based on the T1 findings. The key is having a clear, measurable definition for the pilot.",
            "mentions": [
              45096
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
