            "text": "Okay, let's lock in two initial decisions to move forward. \n1. Objective: 'Design and pilot an inclusive internship programme for hospitality students from socioeconomically diverse and non-traditional educational backgrounds.' Success will be measured by student completion rates and positive feedback from both students and host hotels. \n2. Hotel Targeting: We will focus initial outreach (T7) on mid-range (3-4 star) hotel chains due to their standardized operations and potential interest in recruitment pipelines.",
