      {
        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Co-create the internship framework and ensure policy and academic alignment.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 52968,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, here is a first look at the programme framework for A2. It has sections for objectives, roles, and safeguards. Let me know what you think. This is for T2.",
            "mentions": [
              36727,
              45096,
              72802
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks for sharing. This is a good starting point. I'd suggest we add a clear section on 'Internship Duration and Schedule' (e.g., 6 weeks, 20 hours/week) and a 'Conflict Resolution' process. These are critical for managing expectations and ensuring regulatory compliance.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_plus_sign",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 72802,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "How do the students get credit for this? Is it part of a course?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 45096,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "That's a key point for T9. We need to map the internship activities to specific learning outcomes. For example, a task like 'shadowing the front desk' could map to a 'customer communication' learning objective. We should decide if this is for-credit, a required placement, or a co-curricular activity.",
            "mentions": [
              72802
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 52968,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "Ok I can add those sections. What should the duration be?",
            "mentions": [
              36727
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "Based on similar programs, a 6-week pilot seems manageable for hotels and substantial enough for students. Let's propose that as the standard duration.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 72802,
            "reply_to": "M22",
            "text": "So I need to make a list of tasks and match them to courses? I'm not sure which tasks they will do.",
            "mentions": [
              45096
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 19278,
            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "I'll be providing a detailed task list for A3 in the next thread. You can use that as a starting point for T9.",
            "mentions": [
              72802
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thumbsup",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M27",
            "speaker_id": 45096,
            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "Exactly. Let's decide that for the pilot, the internship will be a structured, co-curricular activity with a certificate of completion. We can explore formal academic credit in a later phase. This simplifies the requirements for T9 for now. We just need to show how the activities support skill development.",
            "mentions": [
              72802
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D4"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": "M27",
            "text": "I agree. That's a pragmatic approach for the pilot. It reduces administrative overhead. So, let's confirm the core structure for A2.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M29",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": "M28",
            "text": "Decision: The internship framework (A2) will be structured with the following key sections: Objectives, Eligibility, Duration (6 weeks), Roles & Responsibilities, Safeguards, and a Conflict Resolution process. This structure is now approved.",
