            "speaker_id": 19278,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Morning all. As promised, here is a draft list of feasible intern tasks for the Operational Handbook (A3). I've focused on activities that are low-risk, easy to supervise, and provide real value. This covers the first part of T3. I've also started a risk list for T11.",
