          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "This is excellent, very clear and practical. I see tasks like 'restocking housekeeping carts' and 'assisting with breakfast service setup'. For each, can we add a 'supervised by' role? E.g., 'Housekeeping Supervisor'. This strengthens the inclusion and safety aspect.",
