            "speaker_id": 19278,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Correct. I've explicitly excluded any point-of-sale or cash handling tasks for that reason. All listed tasks are observational or supportive, not roles with financial responsibility. That's a key part of the risk mitigation for T11.",
