      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Finalize evaluation tools and data collection approach for the pilot.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, I've drafted the Monitoring and Evaluation Plan (A5) which includes pre- and post-internship surveys for students and a short interview guide for hotel supervisors. This is for T4. Please review and provide feedback, especially on the clarity of the survey questions.",
            "mentions": [
              45096,
              72802,
              19278
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 45096,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "Thanks for sharing. The quantitative scales are good. Have we considered adding an open-ended question to the student survey? Something like 'Describe one significant challenge you faced and how you handled it'. It could provide richer qualitative data.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": "M50",
            "text": "Good idea, but let's keep the main survey concise to maximize completion rates. How about we use that question as a prompt for optional follow-up interviews with a few student volunteers, rather than in the survey for everyone?",
            "mentions": [
              45096
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 19278,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "The interview guide for hotel staff looks good. It's short and to the point. Supervisors will appreciate that. The student survey is maybe 2-3 questions too long. We should aim for something they can complete on their phone in under 5 minutes.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 72802,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "Do we need to get ethics approval for this?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 36727,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "Yes, the T4 definition of done requires your review for ethical considerations. I've included a consent statement and data privacy information in the intro to the survey, following standard university guidelines. Please let me know if you see any issues.",
            "mentions": [
              72802
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
